# The Mothercrystals, the Holla crag (CoP 1-3). 1-3 current, the light of Dem (a GM). La Theine's telepoint (one light,
# no light of Holla, Option 0): toPromyvion 1 and 201; finished with 1: nothing; with 0: Promyvion - Holla. Its zone-in
# (one light): 51, finished: Option 1. With the light of Mea added (a GM; Option 0 again): the zone-in with two lights:
# 52, finished: Option 1. The Spire of Holla: _0h0, won (the Wreaker): 32001 (the light of Holla, three lights: complete,
# to Lufaise Meadows). The Hall, from La Theine at 1-3's end: not current any more.
lists LaTheinePlateau/Shattered_Telepoint/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/201 PromyvionHolla/onZoneIn/1 PromyvionHolla/onEventFinish/51 PromyvionHolla/onEventFinish/52 SpireOfHolla/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=334,19,-60 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop TheMothercrystals current
keyitem LightOfDem
login
trigger Shattered_Telepoint             # one light, Option 0: 201
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Shattered_Telepoint
finish option=0                         # sendToPromyvionZone(1)
warp 92.033,0,80.38 PromyvionHolla      # 51
finish                                  # Option 1
charvar Mission[6][128]Option 0         # a GM
keyitem LightOfMea                      # a GM
warp 92.033,0,80.38 PromyvionHolla      # two lights: 52
finish                                  # Option 1
warp 0,-3.8,-240 SpireOfHolla
trigger _0h0
update 32000 option=1
finish
tick 2000
kill WREAKER
finish                                  # 32001: the light of Holla, three lights: complete
